                        "form": "сверхчелове́ческой"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "9414b5ee-ee31-4f0b-a026-588b116adec2",
                        "entry_id": "7d0f862a-ec96-3ace-853f-98951c8b8af8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "сверхчелове́ческих"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8abf769b-5352-360b-9466-c026ef92a67c",
                        "entry_id": "7d0f862a-ec96-3ace-853f-98951c8b8af8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. свойственный для сверхчеловека, существа высшего порядка"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3823cb10-90f1-48b2-8d7a-09efecb727c3",
                                "sense_id": "8abf769b-5352-360b-9466-c026ef92a67c",
                                "text": "Альтруизм ― слишком человеческий, в нём нет ничего божественного, никакой сверхчеловеческой ценности."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5ac08d5-c068-45cb-aff7-96737f304086",
                                "sense_id": "8abf769b-5352-360b-9466-c026ef92a67c",
                                "text": "В проповеди Заратустры среди её демонических замыслов и сверхчеловеческих порывов мы услышали также и чисто человеческий призыв, обращённый к личности: найти себя, стать для себя законом, создать свой собственный идеал."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "078a8162-2cf3-3daa-93b0-5ff3176f9f7a",
                        "entry_id": "7d0f862a-ec96-3ace-853f-98951c8b8af8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. превышающий обычные человеческие силы, возможности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1913d7b-0733-4fdc-b557-bd0a45192187",
                                "sense_id": "078a8162-2cf3-3daa-93b0-5ff3176f9f7a",
                                "text": "Сила у него, вы изволите знать, сверхчеловеческая!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "263d4e4f-6d47-49c5-be35-1a6a8fb4e288",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d0f862a-ec96-3ace-853f-98951c8b8af8",
                        "target_lang_word": "superhuman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "superhuman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06ece0b9-e594-3019-a5f5-a881cf63e059",
                                        "entry_id": "7d407148-415c-3152-9a5b-4fffd8c4bf5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beyond what is possible for a human being."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13ff3163-e33f-4b03-a9e9-88545f10cf9f",
                                                "sense_id": "06ece0b9-e594-3019-a5f5-a881cf63e059",
                                                "text": "How often, during her young life, had she looked upon the face of the dead!—it was now almost more familiar than the living. Again she marked the still repose, the calm, cold hue, the superhuman beauty, the look which is not of this world, here strongly contrasted by the troubled countenance of Lord Avonleigh."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db71053c-4bb6-45d7-991e-457fa8d6a355",
                                                "sense_id": "06ece0b9-e594-3019-a5f5-a881cf63e059",
                                                "text": "An extraordinary character at the head of a leading power in Europe will be the immediate instrumentality in organizing the coming Roman Empire; but extraordinary occasions always bring out such.\nThe great Napoleon, and the Imperial Confederation which he organized, afford an illustration. But the head of the Revived Roman Empire will be, in many respects, a more extraordinary character than the great Napoleon. The coming character will be an unscrupulous, impious, daring person, endowed with satanic intelligence and skill, and wielding a species of superhuman power over the minds of men. He is styled by the inspired Apostle, \"that man of sin, the son of perdition, who opposeth and exalteth himself above all that is called God, or that is worshiped.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16ce7876-d8da-4141-b544-6d0ec9d8c831",
                                                "sense_id": "06ece0b9-e594-3019-a5f5-a881cf63e059",
                                                "text": "I could have flown at him, shame upon me! The woman had confounded and almost destroyed my moral sense, as she was bound to confound all who looked upon her superhuman loveliness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a9dd933-5ed2-4818-a25f-e030b42e511a",
                                                "sense_id": "06ece0b9-e594-3019-a5f5-a881cf63e059",
                                                "text": "No doubt, Jane thought, the rider, in his almost superhuman power of foresight, saw behind the horizon the dark, lengthening shadows that were soon to crowd and gloom over him and her and little Fay."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2073bbe-8358-4844-a4b1-b0f035547722",
                                                "sense_id": "06ece0b9-e594-3019-a5f5-a881cf63e059",
                                                "text": "It is extremely painful to realize that Joe never felt that he received adequate support from his lesbian/gay extended family. Lesson 1: We must not place super-human expectations upon our leaders while mounting them on unreachable pedestals, but rather attend to the very personal emotional needs of their private selves."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "superhuman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67ca4c41-1471-3429-9e3e-08f38beed22d",
                                        "entry_id": "35e8b780-0c2c-3795-9662-0d119baa7878",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A human with remarkable abilities or superpowers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c50849b5-c344-472b-b2d7-2e5a834d156d",
                                                "sense_id": "67ca4c41-1471-3429-9e3e-08f38beed22d",
                                                "text": "Here is a man who, during a potentially testy moment of promotion, retained the clarity of thought to reach deep down into himself, locate the purest possible version of his personality and say: “Fuck you.” What a superhuman he is."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
